{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SfABtfCk3n1794811714.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產東涌藍天海岸分行經理王焌軒表示，東涌區本月暫錄得11宗二手買賣成交，市況表現平穩。分行新近促成裕泰苑B座高層10室買賣成交，實用面積427平方呎，1房間隔，設有露台，業主以398萬元未補價放盤，經議價後，減價16萬元，以382萬元成交，實用呎價8946元。<br/>王焌軒表示，買家為「白居二」上車客 ，鍾情單位有裝修及享開揚纜車海景，見質素高，迅速入市自用。原業主於2019年4月以214萬元買入單位，持貨約7年，賬面獲利168萬元，升值78.5%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.803196+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T13:48:12.658469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:02:33.889384+00:00","content_hash":"f86f548f6a7079a8972b9affb25653a59b4e02ee01bac4a5128deff2b1ee153b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.803196+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}